222
00:14:08.760 --> 00:14:13.760
Paned siia siis sibulad sisse ja,
ja paned teise, teise kihi

223
00:14:13.760 --> 00:14:15.579
siis peale,
ma praegu teen hästi kiiresti,

224
00:14:15.679 --> 00:14:17.340
